---

NOTE ON THE PHYSICS ENGINE

shadecast does not include or link the SOLWEIG physics engine. solweig-gpu is
GPL-3.0 and is invoked as a separate subprocess through its own console script,
in its own environment, communicating only through files on disk. Nothing in
src/ imports it. See src/shadecast/sim/runner.py.
